      "title": "H3 edit prompt | <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.45.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageConditioning"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit <Picture 1>. Replace the ENTIRE HEAD of the main person with the head shown in <Picture 2>.\n\n<Picture 1> is the target scene and must retain its body pose, hands, clothing, background, perspective and camera framing. <Picture 2> supplies the complete new head: face, hair color, hairstyle, hairline, ears, glasses, hats and any head-worn accessories. Remove the previous head's visual characteristics, including its old hair and eyewear.\n\nMatch the incoming head naturally to the original neck, head rotation, scale, ambient lighting and contact shadows. The result is one cohesive photograph of the person from <Picture 2> in the situation shown in <Picture 1>. Do not merge the two heads and do not copy the clothes or background from <Picture 2>.",
        2048,
        2048
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "Edit <Picture 1>. Replace the ENTIRE HEAD of the main person with the head shown in <Picture 2>.\n\n<Picture 1> is the target scene and must retain its body pose, hands, clothing, background, perspective and camera framing. <Picture 2> supplies the complete new head: face, hair color, hairstyle, hairline, ears, glasses, hats and any head-worn accessories. Remove the previous head's visual characteristics, including its old hair and eyewear.\n\nMatch the incoming head naturally to the original neck, head rotation, scale, ambient lighting and contact shadows. The result is one cohesive photograph of the person from <Picture 2> in the situation shown in <Picture 1>. Do not merge the two heads and do not copy the clothes or background from <Picture 2>.",
